# AgentSuite society doctrine (superseded layout)

This directory is the AgentSuite: a collection of agent directories usable as
a drop-in replacement of an ./Agent or .scout/chats/Agent directory.

The current shared instructions are:

- `doctrine` - universal operating rules imported by every agent start_chat
- `society` - roster of the agents defined here, imported by socializing agents

This `intro` file is kept only for backward compatibility with older chats
that still `import: Agent/intro`. New agents should import `doctrine`
directly, plus `society` when they delegate or route work.
